  // %arg3: input tensor<6x7xf32>
  // %arg1: linear.weight tensor<7x7xf32>
  // We need to transpose weight to shape <7x7> -> <7x7> but to do x * weight^T,
  // weight^T is transpose of %arg1 with permutation [1,0].
