  // Since num_groups=channels=16, each group has 1 channel, so mean and var per group is just the value itself.
  // But we must implement GN formula:
  // For each group g:
  //   mean_g = mean over group channels and spatial dims
  //   var_g = variance over group channels and spatial dims
  //   normalized = (x - mean_g) / sqrt(var_g + eps)
